name: Budgeted file-group context, immutable inspection and scope draft recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/group_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted
keys: Space Down Space p Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | engines
keys: m Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Space a Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE CONTEXT | associations
keys: Down Down o Up Enter g
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE FILE-GROUP CONTEXT | group-generation
expect: Boundary: app
expect: One file-group context job
ask: Does generation identify the accepted boundary, inherited context, one request and shared spending without silently including sibling source or starting scans?
keys: t
type: 9
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-context-job
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/group_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
resize: 160x48
live-snap: generation-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: generation-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: generation-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: generation-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: generation-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter End
require-live-snap: 30 y approve | approve-one-job
expect: 1 fixed jobs
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved context job | approved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 L starts the approved jobs | fixed-job
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/group_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 Jobs: 1 · 1 completed | completed
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/group-resume.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 30 FILE-GROUP CONTEXT DRAFT | recovered-generation
expect: 1 committed / 9
ask: Does restart retain the inactive result, one committed call, protected review and the original multi-boundary draft?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 CONTEXT SUMMARY | inspected-context
expect: Owned group component
expect: Source matched at inspection.
keys: v
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT DATA FLOW | inspected-dfd
live-snap: group-dfd
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT SUMMARY | returned-inspection
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for app | local-association
expect: app · exact override
expect: other · omitted
ask: Does explicit selection apply only to the intended boundary, preserving common context and the sibling omission after restart?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | restored-scope-study
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Scope draft ready | discovery-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/group_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planned
ask: Does the final six-job draft consume the exact generated context and retain shared spending, with discovery still unapproved and unstarted?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
